"480 × 800 capacitive touch panel built around the ST7701 panel driver and "
"the GT911 touch controller. Both drivers ship frozen with the firmware. Use "
":doc:`/library/omv.display` to push framebuffers and :class:`gt911.GT911` "
"for touch input."
msgstr ""
